{"strongs": "H3264", "word": "יַ֫עַר", "translit": "ya.or", "root": "יער", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "wood, forest, thicket", "definition": "I. יַ֫עַר noun masculine 2Sam 18:8 wood, forest, thicket ( MI 21 plural היערן (= proper name, of a location ?); Phoenician יער and יר , compare DHM in MV (10) 983; Aramaic יַעֲרָא , wood, thicket ; Assyrian âru Dl HWB 230 , compare Jäger BAS i, 476 ) — absolute ַ֫ יעַר Isa 7:2 +; יָ֑עַר Mic 3:12 +; with ה locative יַעֲרָה Josh 17:15 construct ַ֫ יעַר 2Sam 18:6 יַעְרָהּ Jer 46:23 , etc.; plural יְעָרִים Ezra 2:25 + 4 t. (including Ezek 34:25 Qr , so Co ); יְעָרוֺת Ps 29:9 — \\ \\ a. wood, forest, wooded height , with trees to be felled Josh 17:15 (with עלה go up to), v Josh 17:18 ( J ), Deut 19:5 (not elsewhere Hexateuch); עֵץ מִיַּעַר כְּרָתוֺ Jer 10:13 as wood out of a forest he hath cut it ; יחטבו מןהֿיערים Ezek 39:10 ( עצים מןהֿשׂדה in || clause); as producing trees יער צוֺמֵחַ עֵצִים Eccl 2:6 in designation of Solomon's palace בֵּית יַעַר הַלְּבָנוֺן 1Kgs 7:2 (on structure of this house see Sta Salomos Bauten, ZAW 1883, 150 ), 1Kgs 10:17 ; 1Kgs 10:21 = 2Chr 9:16 ; 2Chr 9:20 compare בֵּית הַיָּ֫עַר Isa 22:8 figurative of foes to be cut down and destroyed נִקַּף סִבְכֵי היער Isa 10:34 כָּֽרְתוּ יַעְרָהּ Jer 46:23 so Isa 32:19 and יער הַבָּצִו֯ר Zech 11:2 (read Kt הַבָּצוּר inaccessible forest ). \\ \\ b. as hiding-place for fugitive 1Sam 22:5 lurking-place of wild beasts Amos 3:4 ; Mic 5:7 ; 2Kgs 2:24 ; Jer 5:6 ; Jer 12:8 ; Isa 56:9 ; Ps 50:10 ; Ps 80:14 ; Ps 104:20 , compare Ezek 34:25 (read Qr , see above) \\ \\ c. stripped by voice of ׳ י Ps 29:9 devoured by fire Isa 9:17 ( ׳ סִבְכֵי הַיּ ; figurative of the people); so in metaphor or simile of ׳ י 's judgements Isa 10:18 ( כְּבוֺד יַעְרוֺ , figurative of Assyr.), Jer 21:14 ; Ezek 21:2 ; Ezek 21:3 (see below) Ps 83:15 . \\ \\ d. opposed to כַּרְמֶל ( garden-land ) Isa 29:17 ; Isa 32:15 but also יַעַר כַּרְמִלּוֺ his garden woodland 2Kgs 19:23 = Isa 37:24 , and יַעַר בְּתוֺךְ כַּרְמֶל Mic 7:14 (secluded and fertile abode for flock, figurative of people, see Che ; Hi - St thinks of sacred grove ). \\ \\ e. = thicket , especially as symbol of desolation Hos 2:14 בָּמוֺת יער thicket-covered heights (overgrown with bushes and trees) Mic 3:12 = Jer 26:18 also בַּיַּעַר בּעֲרַב Isa 21:13 in the thicket (or bushes , so VB ) in Arabia must ye lodge, caravans of Dedanites. feminine עֲצֵי (ה)יער trees of the forest Isa 7:2 (in sim), Isa 10:19 ( יַעְרוֺ שְׁאָר עֵץ , figurative), Isa 44:14 ; Ezek 15:2 , also v Ezek 15:6 ( עֵץ היער ), Song 2:3 (in simile); figurative, as singing before ׳ י Ps 96:12 = 1Chr 16:33 ; Isa 44:23 ( יער וְכָלעֵֿץ בּוֺ ). \\ \\ g. particular forests are: יער אפרים 2Sam 18:6 , see אֶפְרַיִם above; compare v 2Sam 18:18 v 2Sam 18:17 (see also Josh 17:15 ; Josh 17:18 ); יַעַר חָ֑רֶת 1Sam 22:5 (see above); יַעַר לְבָנוֺן (see above); יַעַר הַשָּׂדֶה נֶגֶב and יַעַר הַנָּגֶב Ezek 21:2 ; Ezek 21:3 (see above) figurative of Judah (land and people); see also יְעָרִים below — שְׂדֵיָֿ֑ יעַר Ps 132:6 is a proper name, of a location (but Bae thinks appellative 'auf waldigem Gefilcle'), see קִרְיַת יְעָרִים . On 1Sam 14:25 ; 1Sam 14:26 , see II. יער . — יעורים Ezek 34:25 Kt , read יְעָרִים Qr , see above", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3640')\">BDB3640</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3264')\">H3264</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3293')\">H3293</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3639')\">BDB3639</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3641')\">BDB3641</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>יַ֫עַר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"2Sam 18:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,8)\">2Sam 18:8</ref></sup> <highlightword>wood, forest, thicket</highlightword> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MI')\"><reflink>MI</reflink><sup>21</sup></lookup> plural <bdbheb>היערן</bdbheb> (= proper name, of a location ?); Phoenician <bdbheb>יער</bdbheb> and <bdbheb>יר</bdbheb>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM</lookup> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MV')\">MV<sup></sup></lookup> (10) 983; Aramaic <bdbarc>יַעֲרָא</bdbarc>, <placeholder2261/> <highlight>wood, thicket</highlight>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>âru</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>HWB 230</sup></lookup>, compare Jäger<sup>BAS i, 476</sup>) — absolute <bdbheb>ַ֫ יעַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 7:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,2)\">Isa 7:2</ref> +; <bdbheb>יָ֑עַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 3:12\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(33,3,12)\">Mic 3:12</ref> +; with <bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative <bdbheb>יַעֲרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 17:15\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,15)\">Josh 17:15</ref> construct <bdbheb>ַ֫ יעַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,6)\">2Sam 18:6</ref> <bdbheb>יַעְרָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 46:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,23)\">Jer 46:23</ref>, etc.; plural <bdbheb>יְעָרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:25\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,25)\">Ezra 2:25</ref> + 4 t. (including <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,25)\">Ezek 34:25</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>); <bdbheb>יְעָרוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 29:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,29,9)\">Ps 29:9</ref> — <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>wood, forest, wooded height</highlight>, with trees to be felled <ref ref=\"Josh 17:15\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,15)\">Josh 17:15</ref> (with <bdbheb>עלה</bdbheb> <highlight>go up</highlight> to), v<ref ref=\"Josh 17:18\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,18)\">Josh 17:18</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 19:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,19,5)\">Deut 19:5</ref> (not elsewhere Hexateuch); <bdbheb>עֵץ מִיַּעַר כְּרָתוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 10:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,13)\">Jer 10:13</ref> <highlight>as wood out of a forest he hath cut it</highlight>; <bdbheb>יחטבו מןהֿיערים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,10)\">Ezek 39:10</ref> (<bdbheb>עצים מןהֿשׂדה</bdbheb> in || clause); as producing trees <bdbheb>יער צוֺמֵחַ עֵצִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:6\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,6)\">Eccl 2:6</ref> in designation of Solomon's palace <bdbheb>בֵּית יַעַר הַלְּבָנוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:2\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,2)\">1Kgs 7:2</ref> (on structure of this house see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta<sup>Salomos Bauten, ZAW 1883, 150</sup></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:17\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,17)\">1Kgs 10:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,21)\">1Kgs 10:21</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,16)\">2Chr 9:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:20\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,20)\">2Chr 9:20</ref> compare <bdbheb>בֵּית הַיָּ֫עַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 22:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,8)\">Isa 22:8</ref> figurative of foes to be cut down and destroyed <bdbheb>נִקַּף סִבְכֵי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>היער</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:34\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,34)\">Isa 10:34</ref> <bdbheb>כָּֽרְתוּ יַעְרָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 46:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,23)\">Jer 46:23</ref> so <ref ref=\"Isa 32:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,19)\">Isa 32:19</ref> and <bdbheb>יער הַבָּצִו֯ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 11:2\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,2)\">Zech 11:2</ref> (read <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>הַבָּצוּר</bdbheb> <highlight>inaccessible forest</highlight>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> as hiding-place for fugitive <ref ref=\"1Sam 22:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,22,5)\">1Sam 22:5</ref> lurking-place of wild beasts <ref ref=\"Amos 3:4\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,4)\">Amos 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 5:7\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(33,5,7)\">Mic 5:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:24\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,24)\">2Kgs 2:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 5:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,5,6)\">Jer 5:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 12:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,12,8)\">Jer 12:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 56:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,9)\">Isa 56:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 50:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,10)\">Ps 50:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 80:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"80\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"80\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,80,14)\">Ps 80:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 104:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,20)\">Ps 104:20</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,25)\">Ezek 34:25</ref> (read <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>, see above) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> stripped by voice of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 29:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,29,9)\">Ps 29:9</ref> devoured by fire <ref ref=\"Isa 9:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,17)\">Isa 9:17</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>סִבְכֵי הַיּ</bdbheb>; figurative of the people); so in metaphor or simile of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s judgements <ref ref=\"Isa 10:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,18)\">Isa 10:18</ref> (<bdbheb>כְּבוֺד יַעְרוֺ</bdbheb>, figurative of Assyr.), <ref ref=\"Jer 21:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,14)\">Jer 21:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,2)\">Ezek 21:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,3)\">Ezek 21:3</ref> (see below) <ref ref=\"Ps 83:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"83\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"83\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,83,15)\">Ps 83:15</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> opposed to <bdbheb>כַּרְמֶל</bdbheb> (<highlight>garden-land</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Isa 29:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,17)\">Isa 29:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 32:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,15)\">Isa 32:15</ref> but also <bdbheb>יַעַר כַּרְמִלּוֺ</bdbheb> <highlight>his garden woodland</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,23)\">2Kgs 19:23</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 37:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,37,24)\">Isa 37:24</ref>, and <bdbheb>יַעַר בְּתוֺךְ כַּרְמֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 7:14\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,14)\">Mic 7:14</ref> (secluded and fertile abode for flock, figurative of people, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup>-<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('St')\">St</lookup> thinks of <highlight>sacred grove</highlight>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> = <highlight>thicket</highlight>, especially as symbol of desolation <ref ref=\"Hos 2:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,14)\">Hos 2:14</ref> <bdbheb>בָּמוֺת יער</bdbheb> <highlight>thicket-covered heights</highlight> (overgrown with bushes and trees) <ref ref=\"Mic 3:12\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(33,3,12)\">Mic 3:12</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 26:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,26,18)\">Jer 26:18</ref> also <bdbheb>בַּיַּעַר בּעֲרַב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 21:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,21,13)\">Isa 21:13</ref> <highlight>in the thicket</highlight> (or <highlight>bushes</highlight>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('VB')\"><reflink>VB</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>in Arabia</highlight> must ye lodge, caravans of Dedanites. <b>feminine</b> <bdbheb>עֲצֵי (ה)יער</bdbheb> <highlight>trees of the forest</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 7:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,2)\">Isa 7:2</ref> (in sim), <ref ref=\"Isa 10:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,19)\">Isa 10:19</ref> (<bdbheb>יַעְרוֺ שְׁאָר עֵץ</bdbheb>, figurative), <ref ref=\"Isa 44:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,14)\">Isa 44:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 15:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,15,2)\">Ezek 15:2</ref>, also v<ref ref=\"Ezek 15:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,15,6)\">Ezek 15:6</ref> (<bdbheb>עֵץ היער</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Song 2:3\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(22,2,3)\">Song 2:3</ref> (in simile); figurative, as singing before <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 96:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"96\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"96\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,96,12)\">Ps 96:12</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:33\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,33)\">1Chr 16:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,23)\">Isa 44:23</ref> (<bdbheb>יער וְכָלעֵֿץ בּוֺ</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> particular forests are: <bdbheb>יער אפרים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,6)\">2Sam 18:6</ref>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>אֶפְרַיִם</reflink></bdbheb> above; compare v<ref ref=\"2Sam 18:18\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,18)\">2Sam 18:18</ref> v<ref ref=\"2Sam 18:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,17)\">2Sam 18:17</ref> (see also <ref ref=\"Josh 17:15\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,15)\">Josh 17:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 17:18\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(6,17,18)\">Josh 17:18</ref>); <bdbheb>יַעַר חָ֑רֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 22:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,22,5)\">1Sam 22:5</ref> (see above); <bdbheb>יַעַר לְבָנוֺן</bdbheb> (see above); <bdbheb>יַעַר הַשָּׂדֶה נֶגֶב</bdbheb> and <bdbheb>יַעַר הַנָּגֶב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,2)\">Ezek 21:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,3)\">Ezek 21:3</ref> (see above) figurative of Judah (land and people); see also  <bdbheb><reflink>יְעָרִים</reflink></bdbheb> below — <bdbheb>שְׂדֵיָֿ֑ יעַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 132:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,6)\">Ps 132:6</ref> is a proper name, of a location (but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup> thinks appellative 'auf waldigem Gefilcle'), see  <bdbheb><reflink>קִרְיַת יְעָרִים</reflink></bdbheb>. On <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:25\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,25)\">1Sam 14:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:26\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,26)\">1Sam 14:26</ref>, see II.  <bdbheb><reflink>יער</reflink></bdbheb>. — <bdbheb>יעורים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,25)\">Ezek 34:25</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>, read <bdbheb>יְעָרִים</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>, see above </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Sam 18:8", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 18, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Isa 7:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Mic 3:12", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 3, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Josh 17:15", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 17, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "2Sam 18:6", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 18, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Jer 46:23", "book": "JER", "chapter": 46, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Ezra 2:25", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 2, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Ezek 34:25", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 